{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54605","headline":"兵要望江南 占雨第八（京本列第二○十七首） 三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雨第八（京本列第二○十七首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵（辛本、川本、京本作「军」）始进，雨急立成泥。\n名曰沐（京本作「淋」）屍当立（辛本、川本、京本作「速」）止，别诠吉日与良时，强进必（京本作「有」）凶危。\n（京本注：军谶曰：兵行日暴风猛雨，折旗帜不止，此天怒也，不可进兵。\n待天象和明，别择日行。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}